24 run manifests
24 run metrics
0 duplicate run_id
0 missing condition
0 missing model
0 missing task
all explicit annotations hit
no _generic_annotation usage
analysis outputs go to R4 analysis dir
integrity audit PASS
```

如果 smoke fail，不得运行 pilot 或 full rerun。

